> It'd be nice if we at least re-exported it so users don't need to add it as dependency themselves when making custom asset loaders.

I think this was already done in https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/pull/5359 !
When implementing `AssetLoader::load` you can now just use:
```rust
fn load<'a>(
        &'a self,
        bytes: &'a [u8],
        load_context: &'a mut LoadContext,
    ) -> BoxedFuture<'a, Result<(), bevy::asset::Error>> {
```
